```
# Java/Maven build artifacts
target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# Dependencies
lib/
!lib/**  # Allow committed libraries

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Python (if any Python files exist in the project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Node.js (if any Node.js files exist in the project)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Build outputs (general)
dist/
build/
out/
```